    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir31">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e98">Caput 31</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_1">Lignum offensionis.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir31-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-sir31-Nd1e112" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e115"><seg type="qs">Sicut Adam in ligno vetito</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae splendore eloquentiae nitet, et curiosos seducit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e126">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_12@3-4">Supra mensam.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir31-Rd1e133"><name xml:id="gom-sir31-Nd1e134" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e137"><seg type="qs">Ad litteram, continentiam</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sed sanctorum doctorum <pb ed="#P" n="01215C"/> viam teneamus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e148">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e150">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e152">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e154" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_13@1-2">Non dicas,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir31-Rd1e157"><name xml:id="gom-sir31-Nd1e158" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e161">Quasi diceret: Ne praesumptione aliquid agas, vel antequam discas ad scribendum manum mittas.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e165">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e167">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e169">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e171" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_19@1-1">Utere,</quote>
            etc. Quasi: Sobrietatem dilige, temperanter age, et ne quid nimis, ne in scandalum confusionis incidas. Convenit ergo Christiano ante omnia humilitatem diligere, in lectione Scripturae cautum esse, rectam fidem tenere, modum in scientia servare, et charitatis regulam, ut probatus sit coram Deo et hominibus.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e177">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e179">Versus 22</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e181">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e183" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_22@1-2">Quam sufficiens.</quote>
            Tenuis victus tam animae quam corpori utilis est, superfluus vero e contra.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_22@6-7">Vinum exiguum.</quote>
            Vinum quoque spirituale <pb ed="#P" n="1215D"/> sumptum moderate, utile est tam corpori quam animae: immoderate enim insanire facit, et a Deo disjungit, unde anxia cura, et turbatio maxima, et perpetua tortura.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e196">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e198">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e200">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e202" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_24@1-2">Somnus sanitatis.</quote>
            Subtilior est somnus in parvo victu. Mystice autem qui sobrius est in spirituali vino, in contemplatione veritatis quiescit usque in mane resurrectionis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e207">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e209">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e211">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e213" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_25@11-12">Et vome,</quote>
            etc. Aiunt medici, quod vomitus stomachum purgat: choleram minuit. Mystice autem qui transgreditur mensuram et gravatur carnalibus delictis, per confessionem peccati foeditatem evomat, et per corporis castigationem ad sanitatem redeat.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e218">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e220">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e222">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e224" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_27@1-3">In omnibus operibus.</quote>
            Monet ne tempus <pb ed="#P" n="1216A"/> perdamus, bene operemur, ut mandata Dei custodientes requiem inveniamus animabus nostris.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e231">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e233">Versus 28</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_28@1-1">Splendidum.</quote>
            Ad litteram: ad eleemosynam invitat: Quia <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e240" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIcor9_6@10-17">qui seminat in benedictionibus, de benedictionibus et metet</quote>. Mystice autem qui panem verbi fideliter dispensat, et testimonium veritatis non occultat, in praesenti, et in futuro benedicetur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e247">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_30@6-7">Multos enim,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir31-Rd1e254"><name xml:id="gom-sir31-Nd1e255" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e258">Id est ebrietas multos subvertit, quae sensum minuit, iram excitat, libidinem inflammat, animi secreta revelat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e263">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e265">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e267">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e269" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_31@1-1">Ignis.</quote>
            Id est sicut ignis ferri duritiam mollit, et candescere facit; sic vinum corda superborum inflammans, ad facinus impellit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir31-Dd1e274">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir31-Hd1e276">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e278">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e280" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_32">Aequa vita.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            Vinum sobrie potatum <pb ed="#P" n="1216B"/> vitam aequitatis non tollit; sed sobrietatem, et caetera virtutum ornamenta adducit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir31-d1e288">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir31-Qd1e290" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir31_32@4-4">Vinum.</quote>
            Patet irritationem, iram, et ruinas multas ebrietate nasci, et amaritudinem animae, et scelerum vulnera multiplicari.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
